ink&#x27;)\&quot;&gt;Copy link&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button @click=\&quot;showToast(&#x27;Saved for later&#x27;)\&quot;&gt;Save for later&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="pagination" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;pagination&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Pagination</h2><div class="l-demo l-actions"><a href="/lustro">Lustro foundation ↗</a><nav class="l-pages" aria-label="Example pages"><button @click="page=Math.max(1,page-1)" :disabled="page===1">Previous</button><span>Page {{page}} / 3</span><button @click="page=Math.min(3,page+1)" :disabled="page===3">Next</button></nav></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/lustro\&quot;&gt;Lustro foundation \u2197&lt;/a&gt;&lt;nav class=\&quot;l-pages\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Example pages\&quot;&gt;&lt;button @click=\&quot;page=Math.max(1,page-1)\&quot; :disabled=\&quot;page===1\&quot;&gt;Previous&lt;/button&gt;&lt;span&gt;Page {{page}} / 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;button @click=\&quot;page=Math.min(3,page+1)\&quot; :disabled=\&quot;page===3\&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="alerts" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;alerts&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Alerts</h2><p>Alerts occupy the page and stay until dismissed. Notifications need a clear source, severity and next action. Do not use color alone to explain the state.</p>
