&lt;td&gt;Motion&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-empty\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No results&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Try a different search or clear your filters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;search=&#x27;&#x27;\&quot;&gt;Clear filters&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="forms" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;forms&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Forms</h2><div class="l-demo l-form"><label class="l-field-label" for="sample-search">Search components</label><input id="sample-search" type="search" v-model="search" placeholder="Search by name"><small>{{search?`Searching for “${search}”`:'Use descriptive labels, not only placeholders.'}}</small><label class="l-field-label" for="sample-select">Category</label><select id="sample-select"><option>All components</option><option>Actions</option><option>Feedback</option><option>Content</option></select><label class="l-field-label" for="sample-notes">Notes</label><textarea id="sample-notes" rows="2" placeholder="Optional notes"></textarea><label class="l-check"><input type="checkbox" checked> Send updates</label><fieldset><legend>Density</legend><label class="l-check"><input type="radio" name="density" checked> Comfortable</label><label class="l-check"><input type="radio" name="density"> Compact</label></fieldset><label class="l-switch"><input type="checkbox" checked><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Enable notifications</label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-field-label\&quot; for=\&quot;sample-search\&quot;&gt;Search components&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=\&quot;sample-search\&quot; type=\&quot;search\&quot; v-model=\&quot;search\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Search by name\&quot;&gt;&lt;small&gt;{{search?`Searching for \u201c${search}\u201d`:&#x27;Use descriptive labels, not only placeholders.&#x27;}}&lt;/small&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-field-label\&quot; for=\&quot;sample-select\&quot;&gt;Category&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=\&quot;sample-select\&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;All components&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Actions&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Feedback&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Content&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-field-label\&quot; for=\&quot;sample-notes\&quot;&gt;Notes&lt;/label&gt;&lt;textarea id=\&quot;sample-notes\&quot; rows=\&quot;2\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Optional notes\&quot;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-check\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; checked&gt; Send updates&lt;/label&gt;&lt;fieldset&gt;&lt;legend&gt;Density&lt;/legend&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-check\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;density\&quot; checked&gt; Comfortable&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-check\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;density\&quot;&gt; Compact&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/fieldset&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-switch\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; checked&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=\&quot;true\&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Enable notifications&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="modal" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;modal&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Modal</h2><p>Use a blocking dialog for one short decision. Native showModal supplies focus containment and Escape; focus returns to the opener.</p>
