<div class="l-demo l-carousel"><button class="l-btn l-secondary" aria-label="Previous slide" @click="slide=(slide+2)%3">‹</button><Transition name="tpl-content" mode="out-in"><article :key="slide" class="l-card" aria-live="polite"><span class="l-eyebrow">{{slide+1}} / 3</span><h3>{{['Overview','Details','Next steps'][slide]}}</h3><p>{{['Start with the foundation.','Try one interaction.','Check the result in context.'][slide]}}</p></article></Transition><button class="l-btn l-secondary" aria-label="Next slide" @click="slide=(slide+1)%3">›</button><div class="l-carousel-dots"><button v-for="n in 3" :key="n" :aria-label="`Go to slide ${n}`" :aria-current="slide===n?'true':undefined" @click="slide=n-1">{{n}}</button></div></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-carousel\&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Previous slide\&quot; @click=\&quot;slide=(slide+2)%3\&quot;&gt;\u2039&lt;/button&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;l-card\&quot; aria-live=\&quot;polite\&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-eyebrow\&quot;&gt;{{slide+1}} / 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3&gt;{{[&#x27;Overview&#x27;,&#x27;Details&#x27;,&#x27;Next steps&#x27;][slide]}}&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;{{[&#x27;Start with the foundation.&#x27;,&#x27;Try one interaction.&#x27;,&#x27;Check the result in context.&#x27;][slide]}}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Next slide\&quot; @click=\&quot;slide=(slide+1)%3\&quot;&gt;\u203a&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-carousel-dots\&quot;&gt;&lt;button v-for=\&quot;n in 3\&quot; :key=\&quot;n\&quot; :aria-label=\&quot;`Go to slide ${n}`\&quot; :aria-current=\&quot;slide===n?&#x27;true&#x27;:undefined\&quot; @click=\&quot;slide=n-1\&quot;&gt;{{n}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="close-button" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;close button&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Close button</h2><p>Use an accessible name and a hit area large enough to tap. The toast is an illustration, not a destructive action.</p>
