<div class="l-demo"><details class="l-collapse"><summary>Show delivery details</summary><p>Open with Enter or Space without losing context.</p></details></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;details class=\&quot;l-collapse\&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Show delivery details&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open with Enter or Space without losing context.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="navbar-and-footer" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;navbar and footer&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Navbar and footer</h2><p>A small responsive navigation preview. The menu button expands the links on narrow screens.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><nav class="l-site-nav" aria-label="Example navigation"><strong>LUSTRO</strong><button class="l-btn l-secondary" :aria-expanded="navOpen" aria-controls="sample-nav-links" @click="navOpen=!navOpen">Menu</button><div id="sample-nav-links" :class="{'is-open':navOpen}"><a href="/introduccion">Home</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/graphs">Charts</a></div></nav><footer class="l-site-footer"><span>© Demo Lustro</span><a href="/lustro">Design guide</a></footer></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;nav class=\&quot;l-site-nav\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Example navigation\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LUSTRO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; :aria-expanded=\&quot;navOpen\&quot; aria-controls=\&quot;sample-nav-links\&quot; @click=\&quot;navOpen=!navOpen\&quot;&gt;Menu&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div id=\&quot;sample-nav-links\&quot; :class=\&quot;{&#x27;is-open&#x27;:navOpen}\&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/introduccion\&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/components\&quot;&gt;Components&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/graphs\&quot;&gt;Charts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;footer class=\&quot;l-site-footer\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;\u00a9 Demo Lustro&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/lustro\&quot;&gt;Design guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="offcanvas" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;offcanvas&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Offcanvas</h2><p>Drawer / sheet / offcanvas: contextual details beside the current view. Native modal behavior includes Escape and focus containment.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><button class="l-btn l-secondary" @click="openNative('sheet',$event)">Open side panel</button></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;openNative(&#x27;sheet&#x27;,$event)\&quot;&gt;Open side panel&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="scrollspy" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;scrollspy&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Scrollspy</h2><p>Select a section to bring it into view; the active state is also exposed as text.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><nav class="l-spy-nav" aria-label="Example sections"><button v-for="item in ['Home','Details','Summary']" :key="item" :aria-current="menuSection===item?'location':undefined" @click="menuSection=item">{{item}}</button></nav><div class="l-card" aria-live="polite"><strong>{{menuSection}}</strong><p>Section {{menuSection.toLowerCase()}} selected.</p></div></div>
<p>This is a section-selection preview, not automatic scroll tracking. Production scrollspy should use IntersectionObserver to update aria-current.</p>
<p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;nav class=\&quot;l-spy-nav\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Example sections\&quot;&gt;&lt;button v-for=\&quot;item in [&#x27;Home&#x27;,&#x27;Details&#x27;,&#x27;Summary&#x27;]\&quot; :key=\&quot;item\&quot; :aria-current=\&quot;menuSection===item?&#x27;location&#x27;:undefined\&quot; @click=\&quot;menuSection=item\&quot;&gt;{{item}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-card\&quot; aria-live=\&quot;polite\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{menuSection}}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Section {{menuSection.toLowerCase()}} selected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a section-selection preview, not automatic scroll tracking. Production scrollspy should use IntersectionObserver to update aria-current.&lt;/p&gt;\n&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="notifications" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;notifications&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Notifications</h2><p>A persistent inbox for events that need attention, distinct from short-lived toasts.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><div class="l-actions"><strong>Notifications</strong><span class="l-badge">{{notificationsRead?0:2}} unread</span><button class="l-btn l-secondary" @click="notificationsRead=!notificationsRead">{{notificationsRead?'Reset unread':'Mark all read'}}</button></div><ul class="l-list"><li><span>{{notificationsRead?'Read':'Unread'}} · Dana requested a project review</span><small>4 minutes ago</small></li><li><span>{{notificationsRead?'Read':'Unread'}} · Budget approved</span><small>1 hour ago</small></li></ul></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-badge\&quot;&gt;{{notificationsRead?0:2}} unread&lt;/span&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;notificationsRead=!notificationsRead\&quot;&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Reset unread&#x27;:&#x27;Mark all read&#x27;}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=\&quot;l-list\&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Read&#x27;:&#x27;Unread&#x27;}} \u00b7 Dana requested a project review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;small&gt;4 minutes ago&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Read&#x27;:&#x27;Unread&#x27;}} \u00b7 Budget approved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;small&gt;1 hour ago&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="attachment" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;attachment and file upload&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Attachment and file upload</h2><p>Native file selection, filename and size. This preview never uploads a file.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Attach a PDF or text file<input type="file" accept=".pdf,.txt" @change="selectFile"></label><span class="l-badge">{{pickedFile}}</span><small>Local selection only. Production: validate type and size on the server.</small></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Attach a PDF or text file&lt;input type=\&quot;file\&quot; accept=\&quot;.pdf,.txt\&quot; @change=\&quot;selectFile\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-badge\&quot;&gt;{{pickedFile}}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;small&gt;Local selection only. Production: validate type and size on the server.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="date-picker" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;date picker&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Date picker</h2><p>Use locale-aware native date input for a single date; see Calendar for richer scheduling.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Due date<input type="date" value="2026-10-15"></label><label>Date and time<input type="datetime-local"></label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Due date&lt;input type=\&quot;date\&quot; value=\&quot;2026-10-15\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;Date and time&lt;input type=\&quot;datetime-local\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="choice-card" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;choice card&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Choice card</h2><p>A larger radio target for options with descriptions. Arrow keys move between native radios.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-grid"><label class="l-card"><input type="radio" name="delivery" checked> <strong>Weekly summary</strong><p>A weekly overview of your workspace.</p></label><label class="l-card"><input type="radio" name="delivery"> <strong>Daily summary</strong><p>Updates at the end of each day.</p></label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-grid\&quot;&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-card\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;delivery\&quot; checked&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Weekly summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;A weekly overview of your workspace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-card\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;delivery\&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Daily summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates at the end of each day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="stepper" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;stepper&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Stepper</h2><p>Show a finite workflow. Production steps must not bypass required validation.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><ol class="l-actions"><li v-for="(s,i) in ['Details','Review','Done']" :aria-current="step===i+1?'step':undefined" :class="{'l-badge':step===i+1}">{{i+1}}. {{s}}</li></ol><div class="l-actions"><button class="l-btn l-secondary" :disabled="step===1" @click="step--">Back</button><button class="l-btn l-secondary" :disabled="step===3" @click="step++">Continue</button></div></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;ol class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;li v-for=\&quot;(s,i) in [&#x27;Details&#x27;,&#x27;Review&#x27;,&#x27;Done&#x27;]\&quot; :aria-current=\&quot;step===i+1?&#x27;step&#x27;:undefined\&quot; :class=\&quot;{&#x27;l-badge&#x27;:step===i+1}\&quot;&gt;{{i+1}}. {{s}}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; :disabled=\&quot;step===1\&quot; @click=\&quot;step--\&quot;&gt;Back&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; :disabled=\&quot;step===3\&quot; @click=\&quot;step++\&quot;&gt;Continue&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="navigation-menu" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;navigation menu&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Navigation menu</h2><p>Group destinations with clear labels. Native disclosure supports Enter and Space.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><nav class="l-actions" aria-label="Workspace navigation"><a href="/projects">Projects</a><a href="/calendar">Calendar</a><details class="l-dropdown"><summary>Resources</summary><div class="l-menu"><a href="/graphs">Charts</a><br><a href="/messaging">Messaging</a></div></details></nav></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;nav class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Workspace navigation\&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/projects\&quot;&gt;Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/calendar\&quot;&gt;Calendar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;details class=\&quot;l-dropdown\&quot;&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Resources&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-menu\&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/graphs\&quot;&gt;Charts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/messaging\&quot;&gt;Messaging&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="sidebar-footer" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;sidebar and footer&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Sidebar and footer</h2><p>Persistent section navigation and account/help links. Use named navigation landmarks.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><aside class="l-card"><nav aria-label="Sections"><p><a href="/projects">Projects</a></p><p><a href="/calendar">Calendar</a></p><p><a href="/messaging">Messaging</a></p></nav><hr><footer>Demo workspace · <a href="/">Help</a></footer></aside></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;aside class=\&quot;l-card\&quot;&gt;&lt;nav aria-label=\&quot;Sections\&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/projects\&quot;&gt;Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/calendar\&quot;&gt;Calendar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;/messaging\&quot;&gt;Messaging&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Demo workspace \u00b7 &lt;a href=\&quot;/\&quot;&gt;Help&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/aside&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="hover-card" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;hover card&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Hover card</h2><p>Optional rich context. Native disclosure also makes the information available without a mouse.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><details><summary>Dana Lee · Coach details</summary><article class="l-card"><strong>Dana Lee</strong><p>Lead coach · 12 classes this month</p><span class="l-badge l-badge-success">Available</span></article></details></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;details&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Dana Lee \u00b7 Coach details&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;l-card\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dana Lee&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead coach \u00b7 12 classes this month&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-badge l-badge-success\&quot;&gt;Available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="message" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;message&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Message</h2><p>Keep sender and time with the content. Incoming, outgoing and system states have different roles.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><article class="kit-bubble"><strong>Dana · 10:42</strong><p>Ready for review.</p></article><article class="kit-bubble outgoing"><strong>You · 10:43</strong><p>I will check the task list.</p></article><small>System · Review requested</small></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;kit-bubble\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dana \u00b7 10:42&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready for review.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=\&quot;kit-bubble outgoing\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You \u00b7 10:43&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;I will check the task list.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;small&gt;System \u00b7 Review requested&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="range" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;range slider&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Range slider</h2><p>For approximate numeric settings; always show the current value. Arrow keys adjust the native slider.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Volume<input type="range" min="0" max="100" v-model="volume"><output>{{volume}}%</output></label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Volume&lt;input type=\&quot;range\&quot; min=\&quot;0\&quot; max=\&quot;100\&quot; v-model=\&quot;volume\&quot;&gt;&lt;output&gt;{{volume}}%&lt;/output&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="input-group" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;input group&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Input group</h2><p>Combine a field with units or a related action while retaining a visible label.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Budget (USD)<div class="l-actions"><span>$</span><input type="number" min="0" value="1200"><button class="l-btn l-secondary" @click="showToast('Demo budget updated','success')">Apply</button></div></label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Budget (USD)&lt;div class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;number\&quot; min=\&quot;0\&quot; value=\&quot;1200\&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;showToast(&#x27;Demo budget updated&#x27;,&#x27;success&#x27;)\&quot;&gt;Apply&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="validation" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;validation and field states&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Validation and field states</h2><p>Validate after interaction, preserve entered values, and connect errors to the field.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><form @submit.prevent="formSent=true" novalidate><label>Project name<input v-model="formName" required :aria-invalid="formSent&&!formName.trim()" aria-describedby="kit-validation"></label><small id="kit-validation" role="status">{{formSent?(formName.trim()?'Demo saved':'Enter a project name'):'Use a short unique name'}}</small><label>Read-only reference<input value="PRJ-042" readonly></label><label>Disabled field<input value="Managed by workspace" disabled></label><button class="l-btn l-secondary" type="submit">Validate demo</button></form></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;form @submit.prevent=\&quot;formSent=true\&quot; novalidate&gt;&lt;label&gt;Project name&lt;input v-model=\&quot;formName\&quot; required :aria-invalid=\&quot;formSent&amp;&amp;!formName.trim()\&quot; aria-describedby=\&quot;kit-validation\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;small id=\&quot;kit-validation\&quot; role=\&quot;status\&quot;&gt;{{formSent?(formName.trim()?&#x27;Demo saved&#x27;:&#x27;Enter a project name&#x27;):&#x27;Use a short unique name&#x27;}}&lt;/small&gt;&lt;label&gt;Read-only reference&lt;input value=\&quot;PRJ-042\&quot; readonly&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;Disabled field&lt;input value=\&quot;Managed by workspace\&quot; disabled&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; type=\&quot;submit\&quot;&gt;Validate demo&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="error-state" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;error and retry&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Error and retry</h2><p>Explain the failure, keep context, and offer recovery. This retry is local simulation.</p>
<div class="l-demo" :role="failed?'alert':'status'"><strong>{{failed?'Could not load projects':'Demo projects loaded'}}</strong><p>{{failed?'Your previous changes are safe. Try again.':'Connection restored (simulation).'}}</p><button class="l-btn l-secondary" @click="failed=!failed">{{failed?'Try again':'Reset error'}}</button></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot; :role=\&quot;failed?&#x27;alert&#x27;:&#x27;status&#x27;\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{failed?&#x27;Could not load projects&#x27;:&#x27;Demo projects loaded&#x27;}}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;{{failed?&#x27;Your previous changes are safe. Try again.&#x27;:&#x27;Connection restored (simulation).&#x27;}}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;failed=!failed\&quot;&gt;{{failed?&#x27;Try again&#x27;:&#x27;Reset error&#x27;}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="empty-state" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;empty state&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Empty state</h2><p>Explain why there is no content and offer one useful next action.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-empty"><strong>No projects yet</strong><p>Create a project to start tracking work.</p><button class="l-btn l-secondary" @click="showToast('Demo project created','success')">Create demo project</button></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-empty\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No projects yet&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a project to start tracking work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;showToast(&#x27;Demo project created&#x27;,&#x27;success&#x27;)\&quot;&gt;Create demo project&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="select" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;select and suggestions&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Select and suggestions</h2><p>Use select for a fixed set. Datalist is browser-native suggestions, not a full custom combobox.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Priority<select><option>Normal</option><option>High</option><option>Low</option></select></label><label>Owner suggestions<input list="kit-owners" placeholder="Type a name"></label><datalist id="kit-owners"><option value="Dana Lee"/><option value="Marcos Silva"/></datalist></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Priority&lt;select&gt;&lt;option&gt;Normal&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;High&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Low&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;Owner suggestions&lt;input list=\&quot;kit-owners\&quot; placeholder=\&quot;Type a name\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;datalist id=\&quot;kit-owners\&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=\&quot;Dana Lee\&quot;/&gt;&lt;option value=\&quot;Marcos Silva\&quot;/&gt;&lt;/datalist&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="checkbox" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;checkbox, radio and switch&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Checkbox, radio and switch</h2><p>Choose many values with checkboxes, one with radios, and immediate on/off settings with a switch.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><label><input type="checkbox" checked> Email updates</label><label><input type="checkbox" disabled> Managed option (disabled)</label><fieldset><legend>Plan</legend><label><input type="radio" name="kit-plan" checked> Personal</label><label><input type="radio" name="kit-plan"> Team</label></fieldset><label class="l-switch"><input type="checkbox" role="switch" checked><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Automatic reminders</label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; checked&gt; Email updates&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; disabled&gt; Managed option (disabled)&lt;/label&gt;&lt;fieldset&gt;&lt;legend&gt;Plan&lt;/legend&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;kit-plan\&quot; checked&gt; Personal&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;kit-plan\&quot;&gt; Team&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/fieldset&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-switch\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; role=\&quot;switch\&quot; checked&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=\&quot;true\&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Automatic reminders&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="avatar" class="kit-section" v-show="!catalogSearch || &quot;avatar&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase())"><h2>Avatar</h2><p>Initials fallback and text status. Noninteractive avatars do not need a tab stop.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-actions"><span class="l-avatar" role="img" aria-label="Dana Lee">DL</span><span class="l-avatar" role="img" aria-label="Marcos Silva">MS</span><span>Available</span></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-avatar\&quot; role=\&quot;img\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Dana Lee\&quot;&gt;DL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-avatar\&quot; role=\&quot;img\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Marcos Silva\&quot;&gt;MS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><dialog ref="dialogRef" class="kit-native" @close="restore"><form method="dialog"><h3>Archive project?</h3><p>This is a local demo. No project is changed.</p><div class="l-actions"><button class="l-btn l-secondary" value="cancel">Cancel</button><button class="l-btn l-danger" value="confirm">Archive demo</button></div></form></dialog><dialog ref="sheetRef" class="kit-native kit-sheet" @close="restore"><form method="dialog"><h3>Project details</h3><p>Dana Lee · Launch checklist</p><label>Project name<input value="Launch checklist"></label><button class="l-btn l-secondary">Close drawer</button></form></dialog></div></template>
